  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid big and keep the lead: a 9-bid team earns 45 points for each back-to-back win.",
    "opponent": "Revealed on the first back-to-back win; breaking runs costs the team a lot.",
    "rationale": "Contract-scaled points per event for the bid-tension points target, in Streaks so the points come from play and the size from the bid.",
